mtproto-engine engine_thread::tests::a_panic_outside_engine_code_is_not_reported_and_still_unwinds,
mtproto-ffi tests::every_entry_point_runs_as_engine_code,
mtproto-ffi tests::a_panic_inside_an_engine_call_reaches_the_host_before_the_abort,
