ABI 8 (no struct layout changes; ABI 9 of the eighth change
builds on it) adds it to mtproto_engine.h:
  void mt_session_set_route_admission(MTEngine *engine, MTSessionHandle session, uint8_t required);
  void mt_session_admit_route(MTEngine *engine, MTSessionHandle session, MTRequestId admission, uint8_t admitted);
and MTEventKindRouteRequired (37): request_id the admission to answer,
text the destination host, code its port, flags MTRouteTcp (0) or
MTRouteHttp (1). required 1 turns admission on and 0, the default, off;
admitted 1 admits and 0 refuses; an answer to an admission no longer
pending is ignored. The ABI version checks and docs/swift-integration.md
follow. Tests:
